    "content": "# II · The Will\n*Degree 1 · The Magus*\n\nThe Will is not exertion; it is focus of vector. When intention aligns with mathematical inevitability, friction collapses.\n\n---\n\n### Vector Alignment in Computation and Capital\nThe magician does not command the elements by force of muscle; the magician commands by speaking the language of underlying structure. In the modern epoch, code and capital are the primary elemental fluids.\n\n> \"As the thought directs, the circuit closes; as the circuit closes, reality bends.\"\n\nCultivate precision over volume. A single well-placed sentinel outlives a thousand hurried decisions.\n"
